+
+## Invitation email
+
+Subject: You’re invited: 2026 Northstar Volunteer Recognition Luncheon
+
+Dear Northstar volunteers,
+
+Please join us on Tuesday, May 12, 2026, from 11:30 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. at East Library — Nelson Hall for our annual Volunteer Recognition Luncheon. We will share a brief year-in-review, celebrate six remarkable volunteers, hear a volunteer story, and look ahead to the next season of reading partnerships.
+
+Lunch will be served, and the program will conclude with a group photo. Please RSVP by Friday, May 1, 2026, to volunteers@northstarreading.org and include any dietary or accessibility needs so our team can prepare a welcoming event. Your steady support helps learners build confidence, curiosity, and lasting reading habits.
+
+We are grateful for the time, patience, and joy you bring to readers and families throughout our community. We hope you can celebrate with us.
+
+Warmly,
+
+Dana Cho
+Operations Director
